# Fellowship Event Hall — Project Context

Marketing site for **Fellowship Event Hall**, the event venue at St. Mary Romanian Orthodox Church in Dacula, GA. Production URL: [events.saintmaryro.org](https://events.saintmaryro.org).

## Stack

- **Next.js 15** (Pages Router — not App Router, no RSC)
- **React 19** + **TypeScript 5** (strict)
- **Tailwind CSS 3** for utility styling
- **MUI 6** + Emotion for UI components and icons
- **next-seo** + **next-sitemap** for SEO
- **SendGrid** for contact form (`src/pages/api/sendgrid.ts`)
- **Biome** for lint + format (no ESLint, no Prettier)
- **SWC** compiler (no Babel — `.babelrc` has been removed)

## Pages

- `src/pages/index.tsx` — landing page (Hero, features, stats, packages preview, CTA)
- `src/pages/packages.tsx` — pricing & packages
- `src/pages/gallery.tsx` — photo gallery
- `src/pages/api/sendgrid.ts` — contact form API route

## Key conventions

- **Pages Router only.** No `app/` directory routes.
- **Tailwind first.** Use MUI only for what already exists there (icons, Button, Menu, date pickers).
- **Named exports** for all components except page files (which require default exports).
- **No nested `<a>` inside `<Link>`.** Use MUI's `component={Link}` pattern instead.
- **No hardcoded copy.** Site-wide values live in `src/utils/AppConfig.ts`.
- **Every page needs `<Meta>`** from `src/ui/base/Meta.tsx` with `title`, `description`, and `jsonLd`.
- **Structured data helpers** live in `src/utils/StructuredData.ts`.
- **Brand palette:** sage green `#7c9885`, warm gold `#c9a86c`, stone neutrals.

## Commands

```bash
npm run dev          # dev server on :3000
npm run build        # production build + sitemap
npm run check        # Biome lint + format + organize imports
npm run build-types  # tsc --noEmit — run this after any type changes
```

Always run `npm run check` and `npm run build-types` before finishing a change.

